  None, None],
 ['Russian diplomats at the UN and OSCE accuse Kyiv of strikes on civilians and "secret prisons"', 'New York, Vienna, Moscow',
  'Only Russian agencies carry the statements; the Ukrainian side and independent sources in the sample do not comment, and the figures are unverified.',
